{"name":"Dark Space","hex":"#414a4c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dark space","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["any of several regions in a glow discharge in which little or no light is produced","the intergalactic void"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dark_space"}],"entries":[{"title":"DarkSpace","blocks":[{"text":"DarkSpace is a massively multiplayer real-time strategy computer game developed by PaleStar. Released in December 2001, DarkSpace involves multiplayer spaceship combat between three player-controlled factions."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d3/DarkSpace_Coverart.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DarkSpace"},{"title":"Darkspace (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Darkspace is a Swiss ambient black metal band from Bern, considered to be a pioneer of the cosmic subset therein."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Darkspace_%40_Hellfest_2012.jpg/330px-Darkspace_%40_Hellfest_2012.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darkspace_(band)"},{"title":"Dark Space","blocks":[{"text":"Dark Space is a 2007 space opera novel by science fiction author Marianne de Pierres. It is the first novel in the author's The Sentients of Orion series."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/de/Dark_Space.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dark_Space"},{"title":"Space","blocks":[{"text":"Space is a three-dimensional continuum containing positions and directions. In classical physics, physical space is often conceived in three linear dimensions. Modern physicists usually consider it, with time, to be part of a boundless four-dimensional continuum known as spacetime. The concept of space is considered to be of fundamental importance to an understanding of the physical universe. However, disagreement continues between philosophers over whether it is itself an entity, a relationship between entities, or part of a conceptual framework."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/3D_coordinate_system.svg/330px-3D_coordinate_system.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/45/DarkSpaceGameplayFactionAttackNPC50p.jpg/330px-DarkSpaceGameplayFactionAttackNPC50p.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/45/DarkSpaceGameplayFactionAttackNPC50p.jpg/330px-DarkSpaceGameplayFactionAttackNPC50p.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Teamwork in action: Two K'luth dreadnoughts open fire, supported by a pair of stations.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADarkSpaceGameplayFactionAttackNPC50p.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a5/DarkSpaceGameplayManyPlayers50p.jpg/330px-DarkSpaceGameplayManyPlayers50p.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a5/DarkSpaceGameplayManyPlayers50p.jpg/330px-DarkSpaceGameplayManyPlayers50p.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Multiple players: an ICC armada gathers to battle the UGTO.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADarkSpaceGameplayManyPlayers50p.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Gottfried_Wilhelm_Leibniz%2C_Bernhard_Christoph_Francke.jpg/500px-Gottfried_Wilhelm_Leibniz%2C_Bernhard_Christoph_Francke.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Gottfried_Wil